<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61856" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαμπρότης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ητος</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>brilliancy, splendour</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. καὶ τάξις τοῦ στρατεύματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					1.2.18
				</span></i>
			; of a horse, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				11.9
			</span></i>; of arms, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				11.9.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>An.</u>
				1.14.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>clearness, distinctness</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Phil.</u>
				11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<i>brilliancy, splendour</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.101
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ παραυτίκα λ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					2.64
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				7.69
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ οἵας λαμπρότητος . . ἐς οἵαν . .
					τελευτὴν ἀφῖκτο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					7.75
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				6.31
			</span></i>: pl., <i>distinctions</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιμαὶ καὶ λ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					4.62
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔν τινος λαμπρότητι</span> in
				<i>distinction</i> for a thing, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				6.16
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. τῶν πράξεων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					16.66
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>An.</u>
				2.7.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>munificence</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				21.158
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>brilliancy</i> of style, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.25b
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαμπρότητες τοῦ λόγου</span>,
			Lat. <i>lumina orationis</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>VS</u>
				1.23.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. ψυχῆς</span>
			<i>magnanimity</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				32.8.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				4.40
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b> as a title,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ σὴ λ.</span> your <i>Serenity,
				Serene Highness,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PGrenf.
				1.59
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(v/vi A. D.)</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
